1
00:01:16,998 --> 00:01:17,872
请吩咐 长官
Yes, sir?

2
00:01:17,998 --> 00:01:20,748
我要把所有市民疏散到地下
I am evacuating all citizens to the subway.

3
00:01:20,956 --> 00:01:24,914
组织蝠鲼编队 派遣到擎天各地
Prepare Manta Squad Omega, and dispatch to every part of Atlas.

4
00:01:25,664 --> 00:01:26,248
但是长官
But sir--

5
00:01:26,332 --> 00:01:26,832
现在!
Now!

6
00:01:29,332 --> 00:01:34,540
擎天市民们 请前往最近的地铁站避难
Citizens of Atlas, please proceed to the nearest underground subway station for shelter.

7
00:01:48,956 --> 00:01:50,748
爸爸 你看!
Dad? Look!

8
00:02:01,122 --> 00:02:02,832
快跑!
We need to go!

9
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:05,582
我们无法恢复硬光盾
We can't get the hard light shields back up, sir.

10
00:02:05,790 --> 00:02:07,664
发生器受损太大了
The generators took too much damage!

11
00:02:07,872 --> 00:02:09,332
不必在这浪费资源
Then don't waste resources on them.

12
00:02:09,748 --> 00:02:11,290
B队 那生物如何?
Beta Squad, the creature?

13
00:02:11,498 --> 00:02:14,414
我们试了炸弹和导弹 但完全伤不了它分毫
We tried bombs, missiles, but we can't make a dent, sir.

14
00:02:14,456 --> 00:02:16,122
长官 我是雪倪
Sir, Schnee here.

15
00:02:16,164 --> 00:02:19,540
Penny仍然失踪 但我们已经收押了Arc XiaoLong和Ren
Penny is still MIA, but we've apprehended Arc,Xiao-Long, and Ren.

16
00:02:19,582 --> 00:02:21,082
维持现状待命
Stand by for further orders,

17
00:02:21,122 --> 00:02:23,498
别让这些逃犯跑了
and don't let those fugitives out of your sight.

18
00:02:23,540 --> 00:02:25,082
当然 ,长官
Yes,sir. Of course.

19
00:02:25,290 --> 00:02:27,498
还是只会盲从命令
Still just following orders.

20
00:02:35,832 --> 00:02:38,664
那就是戮兽抓奥斯卡去的地方
That's where the Grimm took Oscar.

21
00:02:38,706 --> 00:02:41,748
比我想象的还大
It's even bigger than I thought.

22
00:02:41,789 --> 00:02:43,748
戮兽不会留活口
Grimm don't take prisoners.

23
00:02:43,956 --> 00:02:45,122
那一个就会
This one did.

24
00:02:45,332 --> 00:02:46,832
你就让我们去-
If you would just let us go--

25
00:02:46,872 --> 00:02:50,622
蝠鲼编队停火 先集中对付次级威胁
Cease fire. Manta squads, concentrate on secondary hostiles.

26
00:02:50,664 --> 00:02:52,622
指挥部正在想办法解决那个生物
Command is working on a solution for the creature.

27
00:02:52,664 --> 00:02:54,622
你有主意吗 长官
What do you have in mind, sir?

28
00:02:54,748 --> 00:02:57,582
从外面攻击是没用的
We aren't making any progress attacking the thing from the outside.

29
00:02:57,748 --> 00:02:59,789
但它的内部可能有弱点
But from the inside, it could be vulnerable.

30
00:03:00,706 --> 00:03:02,706
科学团队正在制作一个炸弹
Science team is putting together a bomb.

31
00:03:02,832 --> 00:03:06,082
准备好后 我们会在离目标尽量近的地方投下它
When it's ready, we'll drop it off as close to the target as possible.

32
00:03:06,498 --> 00:03:08,748
由你的队伍从地面运送至爆点
Then, your team will deliver it on foot.

33
00:03:08,789 --> 00:03:10,748
现在发送集合地点坐标
Sending your rendezvous coordinates now.

34
00:03:10,789 --> 00:03:11,872
明白 长官
Of course, sir,

35
00:03:11,914 --> 00:03:13,872
我们保证完成任务
we will hold the point and we will get it done.

36
00:03:14,832 --> 00:03:16,539
但奥斯卡还在里面!
But Oscar's in there!

37
00:03:16,582 --> 00:03:18,332
你们不能这么做!
You can't do this!

38
00:04:06,872 --> 00:04:09,164
你的那些把戏
That stunt you pulled.

39
00:04:09,998 --> 00:04:13,498
如果你没那么神出鬼没的话 她早就杀了你
She'd have killed you if you didn't just pop up somewhere else.

40
00:04:13,956 --> 00:04:17,498
不过 你可以不受这么多苦
Still, you can make things easier for yourself

41
00:04:17,539 --> 00:04:19,498
只要说实话就行了
if you start telling the truth.

42
00:04:21,122 --> 00:04:23,290
你有没有想过 她为什么招募你?
You've never wondered why she recruited you?

43
00:04:23,832 --> 00:04:27,082
专门是你 来帮她寻找 遗物
You, specifically, to help her find the relics.

44
00:04:28,790 --> 00:04:29,915
我们有共同的展望
We share a vision.

45
00:04:30,622 --> 00:04:32,956
她会创造一个新世界的秩序
She's gonna create a new world order,

46
00:04:33,622 --> 00:04:38,664
没有王国 没有猎人学院
no kingdoms and no Huntsmen Academies.

47
00:04:40,456 --> 00:04:41,914
新世界秩序
New world order.

48
00:04:42,206 --> 00:04:42,998
不
No.

49
00:04:43,248 --> 00:04:47,540
当塞伦集齐四个圣物 世界就不复存在了
When Salem gets all four relics,there will be no world left at all.

50
00:04:48,748 --> 00:04:49,872
你不明白吗
Don't you get it?

51
00:04:50,206 --> 00:04:53,206
她的存在长到远超你的理解
She's been alive longer than you can comprehend.

52
00:04:53,248 --> 00:04:55,206
现在她只渴求解放
All she craves now is release.

53
00:04:56,248 --> 00:04:56,748
死亡
Death.

54
00:04:58,582 --> 00:05:01,914
别撒谎了!塞伦是杀不死的
Stop lying!Salem can't be killed.

55
00:05:01,956 --> 00:05:06,914
她来找我时 我就已经一遍又一遍地杀过她
When she came for me, I killed her over and over again.

56
00:05:07,414 --> 00:05:10,372
她最多只会死去几小时
The longest she was gone was only a few hours,

57
00:05:10,414 --> 00:05:12,372
然后她又会把自己拼回去
before she put herself back together.

58
00:05:15,914 --> 00:05:17,914
直到我再也无力举起手臂
When I couldn't lift my arms anymore,

59
00:05:18,290 --> 00:05:23,040
她向我展现 通过她 我可以实现我想要的复仇
she showed me that, through her,I could have the vengeance I needed.

60
00:05:25,498 --> 00:05:28,540
黑泽尔 你没发现吗?
Oh, Hazel, don't you see?

61
00:05:28,582 --> 00:05:30,540
这就是她找上你的原因
That is why she came for you.

62
00:05:30,582 --> 00:05:33,915
因为她能让你相信 复仇就是你的需要
Because she could make you believe that this is what you needed.

63
00:05:33,956 --> 00:05:35,540
这是你的报应!
This is what you deserve!

64
00:05:35,582 --> 00:05:37,540
是啊 但奥斯卡呢?
Yes, but Oscar?

65
00:05:38,164 --> 00:05:40,248
擎天的人们呢?树不子呢?
The people of Atlas, Remnant?

66
00:05:40,956 --> 00:05:43,206
你做的这些事不是为了正义
You haven't done what you've done for justice.

67
00:05:43,248 --> 00:05:45,206
你只是为了自己
You've done it for yourself.

68
00:05:45,706 --> 00:05:48,622
因为她逼迫着你 让你觉得这是你的救赎
Because she pushed you to think it would help you.

69
00:05:49,956 --> 00:05:53,372
对吧?
Well, has it?

70
00:06:01,956 --> 00:06:05,332
现在的我有价值吗
Now what am I good for?

71
00:06:15,498 --> 00:06:20,498
她怎样了?-我已经竭尽所能了 但她需要医生
How is she? -I've done what I can,but she needs a doctor.

72
00:06:20,540 --> 00:06:22,498
希望梅能联系到其他人
Hopefully, May's able to reach the others.

73
00:06:22,956 --> 00:06:23,956
我
I'm...

74
00:06:25,248 --> 00:06:26,998
我真希望他们没事
I really hope they're okay.

75
00:06:29,498 --> 00:06:33,748
塞伦的怪物制造起戮兽来 远比擎天军队杀它们的速度快
Salem's monster is making Grimm faster than the Atlas military can kill them.

76
00:06:34,456 --> 00:06:36,622
如果我们不阻止它 这座城市就毫无希望
The city won't stand a chance unless we stop it.

77
00:06:37,164 --> 00:06:40,706
它太大了 远比利维坦大
It's massive. Way bigger than a leviathan.

78
00:06:40,914 --> 00:06:42,832
我们能做什么
What can we even do?

79
00:06:43,206 --> 00:06:46,206
Penny发射了阿米特塔 广播了我们的信息
Penny launched Amity and our message went out.

80
00:06:46,248 --> 00:06:48,582
我们就等别人来援助吗
Do we just wait for someone to come?

81
00:06:49,248 --> 00:06:50,747
会有人来援助吗
If they even come.

82
00:06:53,914 --> 00:06:56,664
事情怎么会变成这样
How did it all get like this?

83
00:06:57,206 --> 00:07:00,247
斐欧娜说你的朋友们已经杳无音讯很久了
Fiona said your friends haven't been heard from in a while.

84
00:07:00,497 --> 00:07:04,247
不幸的是 他们最不担心的就是几个小屁孩
Unfortunately, the last thing they're worried about is a couple of kids.

85
00:07:05,332 --> 00:07:07,956
来吧 我们有准备返回的飞船-
Come on, I've got the ship ready to head back and--

86
00:07:08,164 --> 00:07:08,332
什么
What?

87
00:07:08,456 --> 00:07:10,414
我们不能走
We can't leave.

88
00:07:11,122 --> 00:07:12,997
现在巨坑那边有麻烦
It's chaos at the crater.

89
00:07:13,582 --> 00:07:17,540
擎天有军队 但曼特只有我们
Atlas has its army, but Mantle only has us.

90
00:07:17,914 --> 00:07:19,123
群众在死啊
People are dying.

91
00:07:20,164 --> 00:07:22,206
这边的群众也在死
People are dying here, too.

92
00:07:22,498 --> 00:07:24,582
你在擎天没家人吗
Don't you have family in Atlas?

93
00:07:25,456 --> 00:07:25,998
不
No.

94
00:07:26,456 --> 00:07:29,873
曼特需要我 至于金盏花家
Mantle needed me, and to the Marigolds,

95
00:07:30,164 --> 00:07:32,748
我早就不再是他们的儿子了
that meant I wasn't their son anymore.

96
00:07:33,748 --> 00:07:38,498
而且我已经让所有人明白 我也不是他们的女儿
And I made sure that everyone knew that I wasn't their daughter.

97
00:07:39,706 --> 00:07:40,998
管他们呢
So forget 'em.

98
00:07:41,414 --> 00:07:43,540
他们有亨利 就像你们有惠特利
They've got Henry, yours have Whitley.

99
00:07:43,998 --> 00:07:45,832
你懂我在说什么
You get what I'm saying.

100
00:07:47,206 --> 00:07:48,082
我不知道-
I don't know about--

101
00:07:48,123 --> 00:07:50,082
你到底站在哪一边
Which side are you on, anyway?

102
00:07:52,497 --> 00:07:53,872
我们听过这套说辞了
We've heard that before.

103
00:07:57,164 --> 00:07:58,497
根本没有站队的必要
There are no sides!

104
00:07:59,206 --> 00:08:01,206
我们想帮助所有人
We want to help everyone.

105
00:08:01,706 --> 00:08:03,540
我们都要团结起来面对塞伦
We're all facing Salem together.

106
00:08:03,997 --> 00:08:07,372
团结是我们摆脱困境唯一的方法
And together is the only way we're going to get out of it.

107
00:08:10,706 --> 00:08:13,456
所以 你们到底想怎样摆脱它
So, how exactly do we get out of it?

108
00:08:16,414 --> 00:08:20,623
「此世月升日落 尔即行锢其间」
"So long as this world turns, you shall walk its face."

109
00:08:21,456 --> 00:08:23,664
这就是她的诅咒
That was the curse cast upon her.

110
00:08:24,332 --> 00:08:27,414
但只要塞伦分裂人性到万劫不复
But if Salem can divide humanity beyond repair

111
00:08:28,040 --> 00:08:30,414
再集齐四件圣物
and bring all four relics back together,

112
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:33,956
她相信这样 她的诅咒就能破解
she believes that maybe her curse will be broken.

113
00:08:34,582 --> 00:08:40,623
神会再临 审判人性 并永远摧毁树不子
The gods will rule against us and destroy Remnant,once and for all.

114
00:08:42,748 --> 00:08:43,914
好故事
Nice story.

115
00:08:44,206 --> 00:08:46,623
但格蕾欣的死让我明白一件事
But if Gretchen's death taught me one thing,

116
00:08:46,664 --> 00:08:48,623
那就是永远不能相信你
it was never to trust you.

117
00:08:48,790 --> 00:08:50,540
拜托了 请让我来
Please, let me.

118
00:08:50,914 --> 00:08:53,082
可是奥斯卡 -你想让他们信任我们吗?
But, Oscar -You want 'em to trust us?

119
00:08:53,206 --> 00:08:54,664
那就相信我
Then trust me.

120
00:08:58,872 --> 00:09:00,748
她的名字叫Jinn
Her name is Jinn.

121
00:09:01,956 --> 00:09:03,540
你想让她从灯里出来?
You want her to come out of the lamp?

122
00:09:03,582 --> 00:09:04,914
叫她的名字就行
Just say her name.

123
00:09:05,998 --> 00:09:08,248
她还能回答一个问题
She can still answer one more question.

124
00:09:08,956 --> 00:09:11,164
在经历这么多后 你就这么草率地
After all that, you're just going

125
00:09:11,206 --> 00:09:12,832
把密码给塞伦?
to give Salem the password?

126
00:09:13,332 --> 00:09:15,622
不 我是要把密码给你
No, I'm giving you the password

127
00:09:17,122 --> 00:09:19,873
希望你可以找到自己的真相
and hoping you'll find the truth for yourself.

128
00:09:26,164 --> 00:09:27,498
他是个囚徒 小翡
He's a prisoner, Em.

129
00:09:27,540 --> 00:09:29,498
他为了脱身什么都能扯
He'll say what he thinks will get him out.

130
00:09:30,082 --> 00:09:31,914
你在听了我说的话之后
So you're still going to Vacuo,

131
00:09:32,456 --> 00:09:33,956
还是要去真空吗?
after what I just told you?

132
00:09:34,832 --> 00:09:36,623
这是塞伦的新命令
Those are Salem's new orders,

133
00:09:37,206 --> 00:09:39,248
而且我还没蠢到去违背她的旨意
and I know better than to disobey Salem.

134
00:09:39,832 --> 00:09:40,748
可是
But--

135
00:09:40,914 --> 00:09:43,873
你听着 即使他说的是真的
Look, even if what he said was true,

136
00:09:44,582 --> 00:09:45,873
我们也无法阻止塞伦
we can't stop Salem.

137
00:09:46,623 --> 00:09:48,914
这是你自己说的 黑泽尔试过了
You told me yourself, Hazel tried.

138
00:09:49,123 --> 00:09:51,082
他失败了 所以他乖乖听话了
He failed and he got in line.

139
00:09:51,582 --> 00:09:53,706
大块头不会去约他赢不了的架
Big guy's not going to pick fights he can't win,

140
00:09:53,872 --> 00:09:54,790
所以我们也不该这么做
and neither should we.

141
00:09:57,372 --> 00:09:59,082
而且这些都没有意义
And all of this is pointless, anyway.

142
00:09:59,206 --> 00:10:01,290
反正塞伦又不会终结世界
Salem's not ending the world.

143
00:10:01,540 --> 00:10:03,498
她当然会了!
Of course she is!

144
00:10:04,456 --> 00:10:06,332
你们很惊讶吗?
You're surprised?

145
00:10:06,664 --> 00:10:09,914
塞伦就是毁灭本灭啊哈哈哈!
Salem is destruction incarnate!

146
00:10:10,664 --> 00:10:14,248
我们的女王想要看一切终结!
Our mistress wishes to see the end of it all!

147
00:10:14,664 --> 00:10:17,206
没有比这更美妙的理想了
There is no ideal more beautiful.

148
00:10:17,248 --> 00:10:19,582
你如果没从一开始就意识到
If you couldn't see that from the start,

149
00:10:19,790 --> 00:10:22,790
那你肯定是脑袋坏掉了
you must be out of your mind.

150
00:10:24,790 --> 00:10:27,956
好了来吧 布莱克先生
Now comealong, Mr. Black.

151
00:10:28,206 --> 00:10:31,540
你我与沙漠有约
You and I have a date with the desert.

152
00:10:54,664 --> 00:10:57,164
奥斯卡还在里面 你不能就这么把它炸了!
You can't blow it up with Oscar still in there!

153
00:10:57,206 --> 00:10:59,498
那个怪物每分每秒 都在造成更多的损害
That creature causes more damage every minute.

154
00:10:59,706 --> 00:11:00,748
我们不能再等了
We cannot wait.

155
00:11:00,790 --> 00:11:02,498
拜托了 温特 给我们一个机会
Please, Winter, give us a chance

156
00:11:02,540 --> 00:11:03,872
让我们尝试去救他出来!
to try to rescue him first!

157
00:11:03,914 --> 00:11:04,622
我们
We..

158
00:11:04,956 --> 00:11:06,664
我们可以当的测试小白鼠
We could be your test run.

159
00:11:07,290 --> 00:11:10,832
你不知道怪物体内有什么在等着你 对不对?
You don't know what'll be waiting for you inside, right?

160
00:11:10,998 --> 00:11:12,956
所以我们可以先进去看看
So we can go ahead to check it out,

161
00:11:13,248 --> 00:11:15,956
顺便在打探内部情况时找找奥斯卡
and look for Oscar while we're inside.

162
00:11:17,998 --> 00:11:19,914
你们想独自进到那玩意儿里面去?
You want to go inside that thing alone?

163
00:11:20,248 --> 00:11:23,373
你不会为了队友这么做吗
Wouldn't you do it for Elm? Harriet? Vine?

164
00:11:26,582 --> 00:11:28,332
我们不会让情感影响行动
We don't let feelings get in the way

165
00:11:28,373 --> 00:11:29,706
影响我们做正确的事
of making the right call.

166
00:11:29,748 --> 00:11:31,706
用三条命换一条太愚蠢了
Trading three lives for one is stupid.

167
00:11:32,082 --> 00:11:33,706
不 一点也不蠢
No, it's not.

168
00:11:34,914 --> 00:11:36,373
他是我们的朋友
He's our friend.

169
00:11:36,956 --> 00:11:39,373
我们会不惜一切去找到他
We will do whatever it takes to find him,

170
00:11:39,790 --> 00:11:42,123
因为我们在乎他
because we care about him.

171
00:11:45,914 --> 00:11:48,332
我还以为 你是他们里面脑子最清醒的
I really had you pegged as the most level-headed

172
00:11:48,373 --> 00:11:51,040
但我看你也跟他们一样天真
of the bunch, but I guess you're just as naive.

173
00:11:51,664 --> 00:11:54,706
感情不重要 重要的是工作
Feelings don't matter, the job matters.

174
00:11:55,622 --> 00:11:58,248
当失去队友时 你也需要继续前进
When you lose someone on your team, you move on.

175
00:11:58,748 --> 00:12:02,414
让别人取代他们 就像马洛取代了托图嘉
Replace them, like Marrow replaced Tortuga

176
00:12:02,664 --> 00:12:03,456
就像温特取代了
and Winter replaced--

177
00:12:03,498 --> 00:12:04,122
不!
No!

178
00:12:05,082 --> 00:12:07,082
没有人可以被取代
No one is replaceable.

179
00:12:14,622 --> 00:12:16,082
你并不是真的这么想
You don't really believe that.

180
00:12:17,498 --> 00:12:19,956
你因为失去了克洛弗而愤怒不已
You are furious about losing Clover,

181
00:12:20,414 --> 00:12:22,956
你 你很想念他
and you, you miss him.

182
00:12:23,206 --> 00:12:24,956
你又不了解我!
You don't know anything about me!

183
00:12:37,206 --> 00:12:39,373
这就是你们输给RWBY小队的原因
That's why you lost against Team RWBY.

184
00:12:39,706 --> 00:12:42,832
你们总想着去抗拒你们互相之间的情感
You, you try to fight how you feel about each other,

185
00:12:43,206 --> 00:12:45,373
所以你们永远无法成为一个真正的团体
so you'll never truly work as a team.

186
00:12:45,623 --> 00:12:46,373
闭嘴!
Shut up!

187
00:12:46,664 --> 00:12:48,456
你就会满口胡言!
You don't know what you're talking about!

188
00:12:48,706 --> 00:12:50,790
各位 都冷静一下
Everyone, calm down.

189
00:12:58,082 --> 00:12:58,622
好吧
Fine.

190
00:12:58,956 --> 00:13:01,414
我们会将你们放在离怪物最近的位置
We will drop you as close as we can to the monster.

191
00:13:01,664 --> 00:13:02,956
你不是认真的吧
You can't be serious.

192
00:13:03,248 --> 00:13:05,164
他们是逃犯是背叛者!
They're fugitives and traitors!

193
00:13:05,206 --> 00:13:06,664
我军衔比你高
I outrank you.

194
00:13:09,956 --> 00:13:12,622
若你们没能在预定时间内逃出 我们也会投弹
If you aren't out in time, we drop the payload.

195
00:13:13,582 --> 00:13:15,082
生死不论
No matter what.

196
00:13:17,956 --> 00:13:19,164
我们明自
We understand.

197
00:13:29,040 --> 00:13:30,706
你也不喜欢这样
You don't like this either.

198
00:13:31,498 --> 00:13:34,956
其实 你也不想再继续被卷在这些事里面了
In fact, you don't want to be a part of it at all anymore.

199
00:13:35,123 --> 00:13:35,582
我
I...

200
00:13:37,248 --> 00:13:38,373
这是我的使命
I have a job to do,

201
00:13:39,082 --> 00:13:40,456
我也会去完成我的使命
and I'm going to do it.

202
00:13:45,498 --> 00:13:47,664
我知道 你也不喜欢
I know you don't, either.

203
00:13:55,582 --> 00:13:57,956
等等 那克罗和罗宾怎么办?
Wait, what about Qrow and Robyn?

204
00:13:58,082 --> 00:14:00,622
如果我们将他们从关押的地方救出来 他们可以
Well, maybe if we get them out of wherever they're being held, they could--

205
00:14:00,956 --> 00:14:03,206
不行 你们不明白!
No, see, you just don't get it!

206
00:14:03,456 --> 00:14:06,372
现在没有十全十美的答案
This is not a situation where everyone wins.

207
00:14:06,664 --> 00:14:09,082
现在 你们可以跟我一起去帮助曼特城
Now, you all can come with me to help in Mantle,

208
00:14:09,122 --> 00:14:12,706
如果你们还想帮助擎天我可以把你们丢到前线附近
or I can drop you off near the front lines, if you still want to help Atlas.

209
00:14:13,082 --> 00:14:15,622
你的舅舅和罗宾拯救不了我们
Your uncle and Robyn can't save us.

210
00:14:15,872 --> 00:14:17,290
我们需要做决定了
We have to choose.

211
00:14:17,832 --> 00:14:19,164
所以选吧
So choose.

212
00:14:35,582 --> 00:14:36,664
克莱恩!
Klein!

213
00:14:37,332 --> 00:14:38,664
雪倪小姐!
Miss Schnee!

214
00:14:38,873 --> 00:14:41,582
我听说这里有位病人需要我的帮助
I heard there was a patient here who needed my help.

215
00:14:41,748 --> 00:14:44,332
我 我真的很抱歉 克莱恩
I, I am so sorry, Klein.

216
00:14:44,498 --> 00:14:45,706
都是我的错父亲才
It's my fault that Father....

217
00:14:45,748 --> 00:14:47,540
请不要担心 我的小雪花
Please don't worry, my snowflake.

218
00:14:47,748 --> 00:14:49,664
这一切都与你无关
It had nothing to do with you

219
00:14:50,456 --> 00:14:53,540
一切都是杰克的过错
and everything to do with Jacques.

220
00:14:55,372 --> 00:14:57,956
呃 谢谢你这么说
Well, that's sweet of you.

221
00:14:59,248 --> 00:15:01,332
但是等等 你怎么知道
But wait, how did you know--

222
00:15:01,372 --> 00:15:02,164
啊 小惠特利
Ah, young Whitley:

223
00:15:02,206 --> 00:15:04,206
我很高兴你给我来电话!
I'm so glad that you rang!

224
00:15:04,790 --> 00:15:06,248
我可以见病人了吗?
May I please see the patient?

225
00:15:06,414 --> 00:15:07,748
我清楚病人情况危急
I understand it's urgent.

226
00:15:08,206 --> 00:15:10,332
是的 她在Weiss的房间
Yes, she's in Weiss's room,

227
00:15:10,914 --> 00:15:11,832
从那边
Just go up the

228
00:15:11,872 --> 00:15:13,832
我还没有离开那么久 惠特利少爷
I haven't been gone that long, Master Whitley.

229
00:15:14,164 --> 00:15:15,540
我相信我找得到地方
I believe I can find it.

230
00:15:19,332 --> 00:15:21,206
你叫来了克莱恩?
You called Klein?

231
00:15:22,082 --> 00:15:23,498
那姑娘需要看医生
That girl needs a doctor.

232
00:15:24,122 --> 00:15:25,082
我才不是为了你才这么做的
I didn't do it for you.

233
00:15:25,622 --> 00:15:26,372
我知道
I know.

234
00:15:26,956 --> 00:15:28,540
所以这才更让我欣慰
That's why it means so much to me.

235
00:15:40,290 --> 00:15:42,332
你还叫了别人来吗?
Did you call anyone else?

236
00:16:04,872 --> 00:16:07,082
对 对不起
I'm, I'm sorry.